  "scope": "The rectangle case of Lemma7.7 is established for arbitrary specified original-Gamma id/swap contractions on an actual native product of two pure unary domains with fixed old labels and a selected retained nonzero density. The output is actual common forward Gamma volume-blowup chains on their normalized finite volume objects in a genuine containing context. The common-name wrapper discharges independence preservation internally. Actual preparations, finite common unary product, exact two-coordinate volume maps, full-dimensional normalization and retained-density identification are constructed. The balanced and degenerate two-dimensional cases remain established. Nonbalanced-cell rectangle-presentation adapters, uniform4.8 cell-family assembly and higher-dimensional exchange remain open;7.7-7.15 are not complete.",
